      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://www.g-truc.net/post-0734.html says support is \"Any OpenGL 3.3 or OpenGL ES 3.0 driver\". Since OpenGL ES 3.1 and Desktop OpenGL 4.4 are required in `PhysicalDevice::InitializeImpl()`, does that mean I should not check for anything or should I still check for `mFunctions.IsGLExtensionSupported(\"GL_ARB_texture_swizzle\")`? This part is not clear to me.\n\n\n\u003e Why did GL ES 3.0 come in the discussion? What\u0027s the difference between 3.0 and 3.1?\n\nI initially went with GL ES 3.1 because https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/5217#discussion_r2140910854 made me think it was supported only in GL ES 3.1.",
      "parentUuid": "aa9d2cb2_351b930f",
      "revId": "bc29221e53722fd7f1826cbfe103593b80915f88",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
